WEBVTT

00:00:09.470 --> 00:00:13.740
Ouya-san, why are you participating 
in this tournament?

00:00:14.220 --> 00:00:17.490
To give you a new choice.

00:00:18.120 --> 00:00:20.400
The choice to give up.

00:00:21.270 --> 00:00:22.740
Give up?

00:00:23.190 --> 00:00:26.220
Your fate is unbelievably heavy.

00:00:27.300 --> 00:00:32.390
Your choices will change the fates of many.

00:00:34.360 --> 00:00:37.120
Hey, how long are you gonna keep talking?

00:00:37.120 --> 00:00:38.960
Hurry up and start the match!

00:00:40.580 --> 00:00:44.620
They come this far in the tournament 
just to eat mantou and chat?

00:00:44.620 --> 00:00:47.450
How did you lose to him, Sei-nii?

00:00:47.450 --> 00:00:50.250
I'm not the only one who lost.

00:00:50.910 --> 00:00:52.600
What does that mean?

00:00:52.600 --> 00:00:54.610
We all lost.

00:00:55.090 --> 00:00:57.510
All practitioners of 
bukou-style Qimen Dunjia.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:03.440
I'm stuffed. I can't eat another bite.

00:01:05.580 --> 00:01:06.780
Chou Soran.

00:01:07.620 --> 00:01:09.200
What will you do?

00:01:30.550 --> 00:01:32.060
<i>I see...</i>

00:01:49.210 --> 00:01:51.610
Where are you going, Ouya?

00:01:51.610 --> 00:01:53.700
And Chou Soran, how long 
are you going to lie there?

00:01:53.700 --> 00:01:55.820
Can't you tell from the number of mantou?

00:01:56.190 --> 00:01:57.870
He won.

00:01:59.370 --> 00:02:00.520
Ouya-san...

00:02:01.030 --> 00:02:05.110
I'm not making this choice for myself alone.

00:02:05.720 --> 00:02:08.500
You came all the way here 
to convince me, but...

00:02:09.240 --> 00:02:10.120
I'm sorry.

00:02:10.980 --> 00:02:12.590
Don't worry about it.

00:02:12.590 --> 00:02:16.070
I just came to give you a choice.

00:02:17.190 --> 00:02:21.030
It's up to you to decide what you'll do.

00:02:39.930 --> 00:02:43.510
The months pass within my dreams

00:02:43.800 --> 00:02:47.430
I cast aside my worldly desires 
along with my black hair

00:02:47.730 --> 00:02:53.690
If I turn around, the stories of the 
past will appear before my eyes

00:02:55.440 --> 00:02:59.150
In a drunken haze, I laugh at the world

00:02:59.490 --> 00:03:03.030
Shangri-la is nowhere to be found

00:03:03.240 --> 00:03:08.830
No one knows the love of the spring wind

00:03:11.000 --> 00:03:18.050
The beginning and the 
end repeat over and over

00:03:18.630 --> 00:03:26.010
Trading places, they bloom then wilt

00:03:26.470 --> 00:03:29.850
In January, I pick a flower with no petals

00:03:30.310 --> 00:03:37.190
In February, I pick a flower 
that just started blooming

00:03:38.030 --> 00:03:41.700
In March, the peach blossoms bloom

00:03:41.860 --> 00:03:48.660
In April, the wisteria are in 
full bloom above the trellis

00:03:49.160 --> 00:03:52.710
In February, I pick a flower 
that just started blooming

00:03:53.000 --> 00:03:56.790
In April, the wisteria are in 
full bloom above the trellis

00:04:00.460 --> 00:04:06.760
<b>12: An Old Enemy</b>

00:04:07.370 --> 00:04:11.490
The next match is Fuu 
Saen versus Fuu Houhou!

00:04:09.810 --> 00:04:23.950
<b><i>Hitorinoshita -The Outcast</i> comic is now being published in Shonen JUMP+!</b>

00:04:11.970 --> 00:04:14.940
Ah, the daughter of the Fuu family?

00:04:14.940 --> 00:04:18.040
We might get to see their 
Kourei Kenshou again.

00:04:18.040 --> 00:04:21.110
The rumors say the sister can't use it.

00:04:21.110 --> 00:04:23.690
Her match against Ja Seiryan was intense.

00:04:23.690 --> 00:04:26.330
I'm sure she'll put on a good show.

00:04:26.330 --> 00:04:31.050
That Fuu Houhou girl seems 
to be exceptional, as well.

00:04:31.050 --> 00:04:33.450
This should be an interesting match.

00:04:35.390 --> 00:04:37.950
Look! Fuu Houhou has arrived!

00:04:38.640 --> 00:04:42.800
Fuu Houhou, I've waited 
so long for this day.

00:04:43.110 --> 00:04:46.520
Today, I'll settle the score with you.

00:04:48.650 --> 00:04:50.670
What's with the cucumber?

00:04:50.670 --> 00:04:53.470
Not that it matters since 
we're talking about you.

00:04:53.770 --> 00:04:56.360
No one will get in my way this time.

00:04:56.360 --> 00:04:58.850
This is a one-on-one battle.

00:05:18.730 --> 00:05:21.840
Wh-What are you doing?

00:05:22.200 --> 00:05:27.390
Chou Soran, whoever wins this 
match fights you next, right?

00:05:27.390 --> 00:05:30.080
Huh? Yeah, that's right.

00:05:30.080 --> 00:05:32.850
Oh. Okay.

00:05:32.850 --> 00:05:35.220
Huh? H-Hey, where are you going?

00:05:35.220 --> 00:05:36.720
Get back here!

00:05:37.160 --> 00:05:42.090
My mission is to bury everyone 
who gets in Chou Soran's way.

00:05:42.580 --> 00:05:44.660
From the looks of it, in your current state,

00:05:45.060 --> 00:05:47.180
you're not a threat to him.

00:05:48.680 --> 00:05:50.190
What?

00:05:50.190 --> 00:05:53.470
My mission is over. Bye.

00:05:58.070 --> 00:05:59.580
Fuu Houhou...

00:06:01.340 --> 00:06:04.930
Don't you mock me!

00:06:15.800 --> 00:06:16.850
Dad?

00:06:17.270 --> 00:06:19.230
Chairman Fuu! What is the meaning of this?

00:06:19.590 --> 00:06:21.200
It's all right.

00:06:21.200 --> 00:06:23.650
Let Chairman Fuu handle it.

00:06:24.150 --> 00:06:25.470
Y-Yes, sir.

00:06:25.770 --> 00:06:28.280
Dad? But why?

00:06:28.280 --> 00:06:31.560
Saen, we discussed this yesterday.

00:06:32.090 --> 00:06:34.980
You can't fight with those injuries.

00:06:34.980 --> 00:06:37.020
But I...

00:06:37.290 --> 00:06:41.550
In your current condition, 
you can't beat Fuu Houhou.

00:06:41.550 --> 00:06:47.260
Everyone will understand that surrendering 
this match isn't you running away.

00:06:47.510 --> 00:06:51.710
I know you hate Fuu Houhou.

00:06:51.710 --> 00:06:56.010
Do you think losing to her 
will make you lose face?

00:06:56.350 --> 00:06:57.970
Grow up.

00:06:59.340 --> 00:07:00.860
That's not it.

00:07:01.370 --> 00:07:03.640
Then why are you trying to fight?

00:07:04.160 --> 00:07:06.660
You have nothing to gain from 
participating in this match.

00:07:07.450 --> 00:07:12.210
Fuu Houhou chose to withdraw 
out of consideration for you.

00:07:13.590 --> 00:07:17.170
Do you still insist on 
picking a fight with her?

00:07:17.170 --> 00:07:18.660
I-I...

00:07:18.950 --> 00:07:20.240
Apologize.

00:07:21.400 --> 00:07:24.770
Apologize to Fuu Houhou and admit defeat.

00:07:26.110 --> 00:07:28.670
Go on, now. Apologize.

00:07:34.380 --> 00:07:35.980
Fuu Houhou...

00:07:35.980 --> 00:07:36.860
Hmm?

00:07:44.140 --> 00:07:45.030
I'm sorry.

00:07:45.030 --> 00:07:46.510
Don't apologize!

00:07:46.770 --> 00:07:48.100
Take this!

00:08:04.310 --> 00:08:06.530
Stop, Ja Seiryan.

00:08:07.380 --> 00:08:09.190
This is a family matter.

00:08:09.730 --> 00:08:11.430
I won't allow you to interfere.

00:08:12.380 --> 00:08:15.390
I'm not interested in listening to you.

00:08:15.390 --> 00:08:17.830
You're not my dad.

00:08:17.830 --> 00:08:19.310
Don't try to order me around.

00:08:19.310 --> 00:08:23.550
How dare you speak that way to my father?

00:08:24.220 --> 00:08:26.980
S-Saen-san, what are you doing?

00:08:27.380 --> 00:08:30.660
I'm trying to help you!

00:08:30.660 --> 00:08:31.810
Shut up.

00:08:31.810 --> 00:08:34.150
Fuu Houhou, I was wrong.

00:08:34.740 --> 00:08:36.940
I apologize for being rude to you earlier.

00:08:36.940 --> 00:08:42.740
Why? Is fighting the person you've wanted 
to fight for so long such a bad thing?

00:08:42.740 --> 00:08:45.540
Are you not allowed to be 
mad after she insulted you?

00:08:45.540 --> 00:08:48.010
Don't listen to the old man.

00:08:48.010 --> 00:08:49.950
You're not his dog!

00:08:49.950 --> 00:08:51.330
I told you to shut up!

00:08:57.190 --> 00:08:59.010
Dad, I'm sorry.

00:08:59.510 --> 00:09:01.570
I was wrong about everything.

00:09:02.060 --> 00:09:04.950
I forfeit this match.

00:09:09.010 --> 00:09:13.070
I'm sorry you had to see that, Fuu Houhou.

00:09:14.430 --> 00:09:16.080
Saen, wait!

00:09:16.480 --> 00:09:17.440
Saen!

00:09:18.580 --> 00:09:21.340
That was... nice.

00:09:21.950 --> 00:09:24.260
Fuu Saen versus Fuu Houhou!

00:09:24.260 --> 00:09:26.690
Fuu Houhou wins!

00:09:27.950 --> 00:09:33.280
<i>Since my next opponent is Hou-nee, 
I know I'll be in the finals.</i>

00:09:33.280 --> 00:09:38.770
<i>I can't believe I only fought one proper 
match and still made it this far.</i>

00:09:50.150 --> 00:09:51.110
Shinton!

00:09:52.520 --> 00:09:57.070
Ou Hei, you're unbelievable.

00:09:57.940 --> 00:10:00.310
I'm sorry, Chairman Fuu.

00:10:00.310 --> 00:10:03.740
It seems my great-grandson 
went too hard on him.

00:10:04.500 --> 00:10:08.540
Don't worry. He'll live.

00:10:09.550 --> 00:10:12.040
Saen, leave us.

00:10:12.860 --> 00:10:13.720
Okay.

00:10:15.640 --> 00:10:18.560
Ou Hei, you too.

00:10:25.480 --> 00:10:30.590
Ou Ai-sama, what is the meaning of this?

00:10:31.160 --> 00:10:34.600
What? Shinton lost?

00:10:34.600 --> 00:10:39.970
Yeah. Fuu Shinton's opponent 
was supposed to be Koketsu.

00:10:40.980 --> 00:10:43.190
But he was captured by Rikukin-sama.

00:10:44.690 --> 00:10:51.530
Elder Ou Ai's great-grandson Ou Hei was 
chosen as Fuu Shinton's opponent instead.

00:10:52.350 --> 00:10:55.890
It was a truly brutal match.

00:11:12.240 --> 00:11:16.410
What a coincidence. You can summon, too.

00:11:16.960 --> 00:11:18.190
Perfect timing.

00:11:18.190 --> 00:11:22.900
I only just borrowed him, but I'll 
show you the power of this spirit.

00:11:23.380 --> 00:11:26.910
That chilling ki is filling the air again.

00:11:26.910 --> 00:11:29.660
I dressed warmly because I expected this.

00:11:30.210 --> 00:11:32.740
Come, Ryuu Konsei!

00:11:33.170 --> 00:11:35.680
Grant me your strength!

00:11:36.940 --> 00:11:39.600
Damn that Fuu Shinton!

00:11:39.600 --> 00:11:42.670
How dare he use the great dragon 
like some kind of servant?

00:11:48.960 --> 00:11:50.560
What's wrong, Ryuu Konsei?

00:11:50.560 --> 00:11:52.020
Why won't you descend?

00:11:53.740 --> 00:11:55.310
Monster.

00:11:55.730 --> 00:11:57.940
Come to me.

00:11:57.940 --> 00:11:58.730
Wha—

00:11:59.150 --> 00:12:02.650
Th-That's impossible. Kourei Kenshou?

00:12:02.650 --> 00:12:05.680
Only the Fuu family should be 
able to use that secret art!

00:12:05.680 --> 00:12:07.070
Ryuu-sama, don't go!

00:12:07.790 --> 00:12:08.700
Return to me!

00:12:08.700 --> 00:12:11.590
Damn it! How is it that you 
can use Kourei Kenshou?

00:12:11.590 --> 00:12:13.530
Surprised?

00:12:14.330 --> 00:12:18.600
Once I take this monster, 
I'll take my time telling you.

00:12:21.970 --> 00:12:24.220
Ryuu Konsei, please!

00:12:24.220 --> 00:12:26.960
Don't be so stingy, Fuu Shinton.

00:12:26.960 --> 00:12:31.190
It's not often you see a spirit this useful.

00:12:31.190 --> 00:12:35.390
Such a treasure is wasted in the 
hands of a failure like you!

00:12:35.720 --> 00:12:37.160
What was that?

00:12:37.160 --> 00:12:40.760
I understand Kourei Kenshou 
better than anyone!

00:12:40.760 --> 00:12:45.670
No. You still don't understand.

00:12:46.630 --> 00:12:52.680
<i>Damn... He's drawing Ryuu Konsei to himself 
while communing with another spirit?</i>

00:12:55.950 --> 00:12:56.760
<i>What?</i>

00:12:58.720 --> 00:13:04.050
I'll show you the real way 
to use Kourei Kenshou.

00:13:08.430 --> 00:13:10.840
What is he doing?

00:13:11.240 --> 00:13:13.820
How could he eat a spirit?

00:13:20.770 --> 00:13:24.460
This is my secret art, Shokurei.

00:13:24.850 --> 00:13:28.500
Though it's not as powerful as 
allowing spirits to possess me,

00:13:28.500 --> 00:13:32.340
the power I steal becomes mine forever!

00:13:36.380 --> 00:13:37.130
What is this?

00:13:39.390 --> 00:13:41.560
Come, monster.

00:13:41.560 --> 00:13:43.920
I'm tired of eating small fry.

00:13:43.920 --> 00:13:47.270
Once I eat you, I'll become unstoppable.

00:13:47.270 --> 00:13:50.820
Everyone will submit to my power!

00:13:49.110 --> 00:13:50.390
That bastard!

00:13:50.390 --> 00:13:52.270
I can't watch this any longer!

00:13:52.270 --> 00:13:53.540
Yuusai, let's go!

00:13:53.540 --> 00:13:54.010
Yeah!

00:13:54.410 --> 00:13:55.840
Stop.

00:13:56.750 --> 00:13:58.880
You know the rules, don't you?

00:13:58.880 --> 00:14:03.410
Interfering with a match 
is strictly forbidden.

00:14:04.980 --> 00:14:07.020
Don't get the wrong idea, Tou Brothers.

00:14:07.630 --> 00:14:11.660
Fuu Shinton is the one 
who stole your dragon.

00:14:11.660 --> 00:14:15.040
If you're going to resent 
someone, resent him!

00:14:23.850 --> 00:14:27.540
I'll have to stop him by force!

00:14:28.110 --> 00:14:29.370
Ou Shichuu!

00:14:29.950 --> 00:14:31.150
I'm counting on you!

00:14:32.330 --> 00:14:36.020
<i>He's protected me since I was a child.</i>

00:14:37.220 --> 00:14:41.010
He is one of the greatest physicians 
of his age, Ou Shichuu!

00:14:41.670 --> 00:14:43.900
He takes on the appearance of needles...

00:14:45.230 --> 00:14:47.120
Wh-What is he trying to do?

00:14:47.120 --> 00:14:49.200
...and pierces all the pressure 
points in my body!

00:14:51.700 --> 00:14:57.940
It forces all the ki in my body to 
circulate, increasing its strength!

00:14:58.380 --> 00:15:03.960
It's physically taxing, but this is 
no time to be worrying about that!

00:15:08.210 --> 00:15:14.630
I'll do whatever it takes to take Ryuu 
Konsei back from that piece of trash!

00:15:16.420 --> 00:15:17.920
Y-You monster...

00:15:17.920 --> 00:15:19.670
Obey me!

00:15:20.140 --> 00:15:22.730
The situation is changing.

00:15:23.970 --> 00:15:26.570
How can you be so carefree?

00:15:27.080 --> 00:15:30.530
At this rate, Ryuu-sama will die!

00:15:30.530 --> 00:15:33.990
I'll summon my own spirit and...

00:15:34.450 --> 00:15:35.870
Yuusai, stop!

00:15:35.870 --> 00:15:38.310
Let go, brother! Don't try to stop me!

00:15:38.310 --> 00:15:41.110
What if he steals your spirit, as well?

00:15:43.820 --> 00:15:47.630
Then... who will...

00:15:48.220 --> 00:15:50.670
Who will save Ryuu-sama?!

00:15:53.370 --> 00:15:56.040
You don't know when to quit.

00:15:56.040 --> 00:15:58.310
Obey me!

00:15:59.820 --> 00:16:01.150
Ryuu-sama!

00:16:02.430 --> 00:16:04.390
Ryuu Konsei!

00:16:05.020 --> 00:16:06.140
No!

00:16:06.140 --> 00:16:07.560
Return to me!

00:16:12.340 --> 00:16:14.580
Kourei Kai!

00:16:15.720 --> 00:16:16.570
Ryuu-sama!

00:16:16.570 --> 00:16:17.410
You guys!

00:16:17.410 --> 00:16:19.660
Take Ryuu-sama and run!

00:16:19.660 --> 00:16:20.990
Don't waste time!

00:16:20.990 --> 00:16:22.100
You're...

00:16:22.100 --> 00:16:23.470
Yuusai, hurry!

00:16:23.470 --> 00:16:24.280
Right.

00:16:25.200 --> 00:16:26.500
Ryuu Konsei.

00:16:28.780 --> 00:16:35.250
It was only a brief time, but I am grateful.

00:16:37.570 --> 00:16:39.670
Shinton, you...

00:16:39.670 --> 00:16:41.390
I'm sorry, Fuu Shinton.

00:16:41.390 --> 00:16:42.620
Let's meet again!

00:16:45.610 --> 00:16:49.860
Ou Hei-san, I forfeit this—

00:16:48.570 --> 00:16:50.520
You bastard!

00:16:51.860 --> 00:16:52.900
Ou—

00:16:55.390 --> 00:17:00.660
You forfeit? I won't let this end so easily.

00:17:01.010 --> 00:17:03.740
Because of you, my prey escaped.

00:17:03.740 --> 00:17:07.770
You'll have to pay for that.

00:17:07.770 --> 00:17:09.350
It can't be helped.

00:17:09.350 --> 00:17:13.810
I suppose that old fart you 
summoned earlier will have to do.

00:17:15.170 --> 00:17:17.720
Now, come!

00:17:22.770 --> 00:17:25.730
This old man looks like 
he tastes disgusting.

00:17:26.860 --> 00:17:28.400
Stop...

00:17:28.400 --> 00:17:30.940
Let go of Shichuu-sama...

00:17:30.940 --> 00:17:35.600
Seems like you really like this old man.

00:17:36.890 --> 00:17:40.330
Is he hiding some incredible power?

00:17:40.940 --> 00:17:42.690
Don't...

00:17:43.710 --> 00:17:47.200
No!

00:17:48.460 --> 00:17:50.380
You don't have long to live?

00:17:50.380 --> 00:17:53.680
Shichuu-sama, don't joke about that.

00:17:55.730 --> 00:18:00.220
I understand my own body best.

00:18:00.700 --> 00:18:04.810
My pulse has been getting weaker.

00:18:04.810 --> 00:18:07.230
My time will come soon.

00:18:07.570 --> 00:18:11.000
People are born, grow 
old, fall ill, and die.

00:18:11.000 --> 00:18:13.470
It's not something to hate.

00:18:13.470 --> 00:18:14.490
But—

00:18:14.490 --> 00:18:22.350
More importantly, I invited you here 
because I wanted to ask you something.

00:18:23.030 --> 00:18:28.910
Is the Kourei Kenshou you described to 
me truly such an incredible technique?

00:18:28.910 --> 00:18:30.350
Huh? Er, no...

00:18:31.260 --> 00:18:35.140
I just exaggerated a little the other day.

00:18:35.140 --> 00:18:37.020
I didn't think you'd take it seriously.

00:18:37.020 --> 00:18:38.920
Don't lie to me.

00:18:39.850 --> 00:18:41.800
We've known each other a long time.

00:18:42.180 --> 00:18:45.580
I always know when you're lying.

00:18:47.770 --> 00:18:51.810
When people die, their souls dissipate.

00:18:51.810 --> 00:18:56.010
Their ki becomes wind, and their 
bodies return to the earth.

00:18:57.210 --> 00:19:00.700
With your Kourei Kenshou,

00:19:00.700 --> 00:19:03.970
is it really possible for my spirit 
to remain in this world

00:19:03.970 --> 00:19:07.930
and pass on my abilities to the user?

00:19:08.790 --> 00:19:11.550
That's what I want to ask.

00:19:11.550 --> 00:19:17.970
Yes, but if you wish to remain 
in this world as a spirit,

00:19:17.970 --> 00:19:20.340
you don't need to use Kourei Kenshou.

00:19:20.340 --> 00:19:22.110
You could be summoned.

00:19:22.110 --> 00:19:24.120
Then I have no choice.

00:19:24.670 --> 00:19:26.930
Hey, Shin-chan.

00:19:26.930 --> 00:19:27.680
Huh?

00:19:27.680 --> 00:19:31.530
Has your father taught you Kourei Kenshou?

00:19:31.870 --> 00:19:33.570
Yeah, I can do it.

00:19:35.000 --> 00:19:36.610
I see, I see.

00:19:36.610 --> 00:19:41.770
Then when I die, will you 
inherit my medical knowledge?

00:19:41.770 --> 00:19:42.650
Sure.

00:19:42.650 --> 00:19:43.040
Hey!

00:19:43.040 --> 00:19:43.520
Ow!

00:19:44.660 --> 00:19:46.960
Dad, that hurts.

00:19:46.960 --> 00:19:48.620
That's not your decision to make!

00:19:48.620 --> 00:19:50.450
Now, now.

00:19:50.450 --> 00:19:54.080
Don't shout. You'll frighten Shin-chan.

00:19:54.080 --> 00:19:57.450
Shichuu-sama, don't make 
that request so lightly.

00:19:57.450 --> 00:20:01.480
Kourei Kenshou is the art of 
forcing spirits into submission.

00:20:01.480 --> 00:20:03.060
Submission?

00:20:03.060 --> 00:20:09.650
Then let me ask: if I serve 
you, will my soul suffer?

00:20:10.000 --> 00:20:15.490
Well... as long as we don't deliberately 
cause suffering, it won't.

00:20:16.160 --> 00:20:18.060
Then it's fine, is it not?

00:20:18.410 --> 00:20:22.960
B-But we've always looked up to you.

00:20:22.960 --> 00:20:24.980
We could never do anything to—

00:20:24.980 --> 00:20:26.210
It doesn't matter.

00:20:27.190 --> 00:20:32.800
I was already planning to 
offer my body and soul

00:20:32.800 --> 00:20:37.080
for medical advancement after my death.

00:20:37.610 --> 00:20:41.380
As a man who's been a doctor all his life,

00:20:41.380 --> 00:20:45.740
nothing would satisfy me 
more than helping you.

00:20:46.390 --> 00:20:53.180
Fuu-chan, I trust you and love this boy.

00:20:53.930 --> 00:20:55.550
Please.

00:20:56.690 --> 00:21:01.430
You'll become a soul and 
remain in this world.

00:21:02.980 --> 00:21:06.650
You want to stay with 
your wife, Shichuu-sama.

00:21:06.940 --> 00:21:08.150
Fuu-chan.

00:21:09.390 --> 00:21:10.530
Please.

00:21:12.280 --> 00:21:13.520
Very well.

00:21:14.710 --> 00:21:18.540
Shinton, lower your head to Shichuu-sama.

00:21:18.540 --> 00:21:19.820
Okay.

00:21:19.820 --> 00:21:22.500
Thanks, Grandpa Shichuu.

00:21:28.550 --> 00:21:29.940
Grandpa...

00:21:31.490 --> 00:21:34.540
Grandpa Shichuu...

00:21:38.390 --> 00:21:40.900
Grandpa Shichuu...

00:21:44.020 --> 00:21:49.010
Grandpa Shichuu!

00:21:50.410 --> 00:21:54.120
The sun came up, aiya, and it's 
a clear and beautiful day, aiya

00:21:54.330 --> 00:21:58.080
The river cleanses the foot of 
the mountain as it flows through

00:21:58.330 --> 00:22:02.170
There are fish slowly swimming by, 
they're fat and look delicious

00:22:02.380 --> 00:22:06.090
But I don't want any if you 
don't cook them with red peppers

00:22:06.260 --> 00:22:10.220
But I don't want any if you 
don't cook them with red peppers

00:22:11.680 --> 00:22:14.310
Cute, cute girl

00:22:15.730 --> 00:22:18.190
She has such a calm face

00:22:18.400 --> 00:22:22.110
But with her giant shovel, 
she goes from one hill to the next

00:22:22.360 --> 00:22:25.690
And fills them with holes

00:22:26.240 --> 00:22:29.950
I don't know where she came from

00:22:30.200 --> 00:22:33.790
But if you make her mad, she'll punch you

00:22:34.040 --> 00:22:37.920
She's always in a daze, 
but she's terrifying

00:22:38.120 --> 00:22:41.710
She'll smack you without 
warning if you're stupid

00:22:42.340 --> 00:22:45.840
Even in dark places where 
the moon doesn't shine

00:22:46.130 --> 00:22:49.800
This dignified girl is never scared

00:22:50.050 --> 00:22:53.890
She works hard all night burying

00:22:54.140 --> 00:22:58.060
She buries others in order to survive

00:22:58.440 --> 00:23:02.310
The sun came up, aiya, and it's 
a clear and beautiful day, aiya

00:23:02.520 --> 00:23:06.190
The river cleanses the foot of 
the mountain as it flows through

00:23:06.400 --> 00:23:10.070
There are fish slowly swimming by, 
they're fat and look delicious

00:23:10.360 --> 00:23:14.160
But I don't want any if you 
don't cook them with red peppers

00:23:14.330 --> 00:23:16.910
But I don't want any if you 
don't have red peppers...

00:23:17.290 --> 00:23:19.250
I don't, I don't, I don't!

00:23:20.040 --> 00:23:21.290
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:20.540 --> 00:23:22.720
It's finally the semifinals, Hou-nee.

00:23:22.720 --> 00:23:27.050
Wow, some foreigners have 
come to watch our match.

00:23:27.050 --> 00:23:30.380
I won't hold back just 
because you're my opponent!

00:23:30.380 --> 00:23:33.140
Bring it on. Give me everything you've got.

00:23:33.140 --> 00:23:36.240
Next time on <i>Hitorinoshita - 
The Outcast</i>, "Kourei Kenshou."

00:23:36.240 --> 00:23:39.180
Chou Soran, I will take your life.

00:23:36.640 --> 00:23:40.060
<b>13: Kourei Kenshou</b>
